# HS: the store set — every `Elaborator` field whose type is a map / set keyed by `String`
# (through Option / RefCell / Rc / Box / Bound) ; g3 name_keyed_fields.txt's 86 less its
# `std` (a tool artifact) and two u32-keyed maps of name sets, plus two `pkg_array_const_*`.
